# Default User Roles

Seed these roles on install. See `permissions.mdc` for access semantics.

## Shipped Roles

| role_key | modules | perms summary |
|---|---|---|
| super_admin | all active | platform manage |
| tenant_admin | all entitled | tenant manage |
| facility_admin | facility modules | facility manage |
| integration_admin | integrations, reports_audit | integration and audit manage |
| doctor | opd, ipd, clinical, triage, lab, radiology, pharmacy, nursing, billing, reports_audit, patient_registry | clinical care and diagnostics |
| nurse | opd, ipd, nursing, triage, lab, radiology, pharmacy, housekeeping, patient_registry | ward care and registry |
| receptionist | opd, ipd, billing, patient_registry, communications | registration and queues |
| accountant | billing, claims, reports_audit, opd, ipd | finance and reporting |
| pharmacist | pharmacy, billing(view) | dispense and manage stock |
| laboratory_technician | lab | report and manage lab work |
| radiographer | radiology, opd | scan workflow |
| radiologist | radiology, opd, ipd | interpret and manage imaging |
| physiotherapist | physiotherapy, opd, ipd, patient_registry | therapy workflow |
| discharge_planner | discharge, ipd, nursing(view) | discharge coordination |
| operations_staff | operations | operations manage |
| housekeeper | housekeeping | cleaning and turnover |
| biomedical_engineer | biomedical | equipment maintenance |
| mortuary_attendant | mortuary | mortuary operations |
| hr_staff | hr, access_admin(limited) | HR administration |
| patient | patient-facing modules | own-data only |
| visitor_guest | communications | limited visitor info |

## Administration

- Roles must be created automatically at setup.
- Admins may add custom roles that use the same vocabulary.
- Reset must restore this shipped matrix atomically.
- Failed changes must roll back completely and remain auditable.
- Frontend and backend must deny unauthorized menus, actions, and workflows.

